WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.226
Rat was glad to see Otter.

2
00:00:03.227 --> 00:00:06.123
Otter was a Riverbanker.

3
00:00:06.124 --> 00:00:09.831
"Otter, this is Mole," said Rat.

4
00:00:09.832 --> 00:00:12.258
"We’re just about to eat."

5
00:00:12.259 --> 00:00:15.333
Sounds came from the bushes.

6
00:00:15.334 --> 00:00:17.577
They all looked.

7
00:00:17.578 --> 00:00:19.686
It was Badger!

8
00:00:19.687 --> 00:00:22.783
He pushed through the leaves.

9
00:00:22.784 --> 00:00:24.761
Badger stared at them.

10
00:00:24.762 --> 00:00:27.134
"Hmmph!" he said.

11
00:00:27.135 --> 00:00:31.141
Badger turned and went into the bushes again.

12
00:00:31.142 --> 00:00:35.980
"He didn’t say hello," said Mole, surprised.

13
00:00:35.981 --> 00:00:38.604
"I told you," Rat said.

14
00:00:38.605 --> 00:00:42.123
"Badger likes to be alone."

15
00:00:42.124 --> 00:00:45.829
After lunch Rat packed up the basket.

16
00:00:45.830 --> 00:00:49.903
"Guess who is on the river today?" said Otter.

17
00:00:49.904 --> 00:00:52.025
"Who?" asked Rat.

18
00:00:52.026 --> 00:00:56.883
"Toad! He’s in his new racing boat," said Otter.

19
00:00:56.884 --> 00:01:01.033
"Toad is always trying new things," said Rat. "But

20
00:01:01.034 --> 00:01:05.008
he’s never good at them," laughed Otter. "Well,

21
00:01:05.009 --> 00:01:07.238
I’m leaving! Nice

22
00:01:07.239 --> 00:01:13.139
meeting you, Mole." Mole

23
00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:16.106
was putting the oars in the boat. "We're

24
00:01:16.107 --> 00:01:18.990
going too," said Rat. "Oh,

25
00:01:18.991 --> 00:01:23.622
Rat, please let me row," cried Mole. "Not

26
00:01:23.623 --> 00:01:28.578
yet. You need a few lessons," said Rat. Mole

27
00:01:28.579 --> 00:01:31.291
climbed into the boat. Rat

28
00:01:31.292 --> 00:01:34.917
hopped in and untied the boat. "Rowing

29
00:01:34.918 --> 00:01:39.008
can’t be very hard," Mole thought. Quickly

30
00:01:39.009 --> 00:01:42.043
he grabbed the oars! "Stop,

31
00:01:42.044 --> 00:01:46.545
you’ll make us tip over!" cried Rat. The

32
00:01:46.546 --> 00:01:50.162
boat tipped back and forth. Mole

33
00:01:50.163 --> 00:01:52.301
lost his balance. Sploosh

34
00:01:52.302 --> 00:01:58.975
! They fell into the cold water.

